          {
            "title": "Question #1",
            "id": 120354,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir HTTP isteği başarısız olduğunda her zaman yapmak istediğimiz şeylerden biri nedir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kullanıcıya bir hata mesajı gönder</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Durum kodunu <code>200</code> olarak ayarla</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">İsteği başka bir sunucuya gönder</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kullanıcıya bir hata mesajı gönder.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir HTTP isteği başarısız olduğunda her zaman yapmak istediğimiz şeylerden biri nedir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kullanıcıya bir hata mesajı gönder</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Durum kodunu <code>200</code> olarak ayarla</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">İsteği başka bir sunucuya gönder</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Kullanıcıya yanıt vermeden isteği yeniden dene</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kullanıcıya bir hata mesajı gönder.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example #2",
            "id": 120359,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İstemci tarafından gönderilen bilgileri kaydetmek için <code>GET</code> isteğini tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/books/:title&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { title } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM books WHERE title = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedBook = db.prepare(sql).get(title);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedBook) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"book\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedBook\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"71\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>req.params</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question #4",
            "id": 120357,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>HTTP durum kodunu ayarlamak için bu <code>GET</code> isteğinde hangi kodu kullanırız?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/books/:title&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { title } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM books WHERE title = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedBook = db.prepare(sql).get(title);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedBook) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"book\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedBook\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>res.status</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.json</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.params</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>res.status</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Eksik üye dalı <code>res.status(...).json(...)</code> zincirini kullanıyor. Bu zincir ne yapar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/books/:title&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { title } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM books WHERE title = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedBook = db.prepare(sql).get(title);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedBook) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"book\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedBook\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Hata durumunu ayarlar, ardından JSON hata gövdesini gönderir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Önce JSON gönderir, ardından yanıt bittikten sonra durumu değiştirir</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sorguyu yeniden denemeden önce rota parametresini değiştirir</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Eksik satırı başarılı bir yanıta dönüştürür</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Hata durumunu ayarlar, ardından JSON hata gövdesini gönderir.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example #4",
            "id": 120361,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yanıt nesnesinde <code>404</code> hata kodunu ayarlamak için kodu tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/books/:title&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { title } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM books WHERE title = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedBook = db.prepare(sql).get(title);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedBook) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"book\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedBook\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"210\" endIndex=\"222\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>.status(404)</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: SQL Database Connection",
            "id": 120848,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Veritabanı bağlantımız <code>db</code> değişkeninde saklanıyorsa, <code>sql</code> değişkeninde saklanan bir SQL ifadesini nasıl hazırlarız?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>db.prepare(sql)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>db.execute(sql)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>db.query(sql)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>db.prepare(sql)</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>sql = \"SELECT * FROM flights\"</code> değerini ayarlayıp <code>db.prepare(\"sql\")</code> yazıyorsun.</p><p>Depoladığın sorguyu hangi değişiklik hazırlar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>db.prepare(sql)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>db.prepare(\"SELECT * FROM sql\")</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>sql.prepare(db)</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>db.prepare(db)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>db.prepare(sql)</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Response",
            "id": 120935,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir <code>POST</code> uç noktası yanıtında hangi bilgileri içermelidir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Bir durum kodu ve verilerin eklendiğine dair bir onay</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir durum kodu ve yalnızca yeni veri girdisi</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sadece bir durum kodu</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Bir durum kodu ve verilerin eklendiğine dair bir onay.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Başarıyla bir uçuş ekledin. Hangi yanıt, uygun durumu ayarlayıp eklemeyi açıkça onaylar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>201</code> durumu ve <code>\"Flight added successfully\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>404</code> durumu ve <code>\"Flight added successfully\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>201</code> durumu ve yalnızca yeni uçuş verileri</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>201</code> durumu ve <code>\"Flight deleted successfully\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>201</code> durumu ve <code>\"Flight added successfully\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Endpoint Path",
            "id": 120849,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Doğru uç noktayı seç.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/flights&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM flights&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" flights = db.prepare(sql).all();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"flights\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": flights\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;/flights/:number&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"/flights\"</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tüm uçuşları döndüren koleksiyon endpoint'ini tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/flights&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM flights&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" flights = db.prepare(sql).all();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"flights\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": flights\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;/flights/:id&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".get()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>get</code>, ardından <code>\"/flights\"</code>, <code>\"SELECT * FROM flights\"</code> ve son olarak <code>.all()</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question #2",
            "id": 120355,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kullanıcı mevcut olmayan bir üye istediğinde Express kodu ne yapar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/members/:name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { name } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM members WHERE name = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedMember = db.prepare(sql).get(name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedMember) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested member&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"member\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedMember\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">İstemciye bir hata mesajı gönderir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir hata oluşur ve istemci hiçbir bilgi almaz</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sunucu ek bilgi istiyor</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">İstemciye bir hata mesajı gönderir.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Veritabanı araması hiçbir üye döndürmeyebilir. İşleyici başarı JSON'u göndermeden önce sonucu neden kontrol eder?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/members/:name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { name } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM members WHERE name = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedMember = db.prepare(sql).get(name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedMember) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested member&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"member\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedMember\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Yanlış bir başarı yanıtı yerine eksik üye hatası döndürmek için</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir üye bulunana kadar aynı aramayı yeniden çalıştırmak için</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">İstenen id'yi ilk üyenin id'siyle değiştirmek için</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Hiç üye yoksa otomatik olarak yeni bir üye eklemek için</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Yanlış bir başarı yanıtı yerine eksik üye hatası döndürmek için.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: SQL & PUT & DELETE",
            "id": 120994,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>PUT uç noktasıyla hangi tür SQL ifadesi ilişkilidir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">GÜNCELLE</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">SİL</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">BIRAK</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">GÜNCELLE öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir <code>PUT /flights/:id</code> işleyicisi belirtilen uçuşun kayıtlı alanlarını değiştiriyor. Hangi SQL yapısı bu işlemle eşleşir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>UPDATE flights ... WHERE id = ?</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>DELETE FROM flights WHERE id = ?</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>DROP TABLE flights</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">id koşulu olmayan <code>INSERT INTO flights ...</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>UPDATE flights ... WHERE id = ?</code></p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: DELETE II",
            "id": 120998,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>DELETE</code> uç noktası için <code>response</code> söz dizimini tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.delete(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/flights/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { id } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;DELETE FROM flights WHERE id = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = db.prepare(sql).run(id);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (result.changes &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"     \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Flight deleted successfully&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"     \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Flight not found&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"197\" endIndex=\"200\" /><option startIndex=\"200\" endIndex=\"201\" /><option startIndex=\"201\" endIndex=\"207\" /><option startIndex=\"207\" endIndex=\"208\" /><option startIndex=\"208\" endIndex=\"211\" /><option startIndex=\"211\" endIndex=\"212\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"201\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>res</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve sonra <code>status</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>200</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
